\n1 Reagent Lane, Fair Lawn, NJ 07410, USA Fax 201-796-1329--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSodium Metasilicate (https://doi.usp.org/USPFCC/FCC_F100568_03_01.html)\nciteturn26search1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 months ago; At 30°, the anhydrous Sodium Metasilicate is readily soluble in water (270 g/L) as is its pentahydrate (610 g/L).\n\nSodium Metasilicate\n\nNa_{2}O·SiO_{2}·xH_{2}O Formula wt, anhydrous 122.06\n550 [6834-92-0]\n\n## DESCRIPTION\n\nSodium Metasilicate occurs as a white, free-flowing, granular material. It is a hydrous (pentahydrate) or anhydrous silicate having a 1 : 1 molar ratio of SiO_{2} to Na_{2}O. At 30°, the anhydrous Sodium Metasilicate is readily soluble in water (270 g/L) as is its pentahydrate (610 g/L). The pH values of 1% solutions of anhydrous Sodium Metasilicate and its pentahydrate are about 12.6 and 12.4, respectively.\n\nUnited States Pharmacopeia (2008). Monographs, Sodium Metasilicate. FCC. Rockville, MD: United States Pharmacopeia.\n\nDOI: https://doi.org/10.31003/FCC_F100568_03_01--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Certificate of Analysis (https://www.sigmaaldrich.cn/certificates/sapfs/PROD/sap/certificate_pdfs/COFA/Q14/398128-50G0000426388.pdf)\nciteturn26search15 [wordlim: 200] Published: 1.7 years ago; Website: www.sigma-aldrich.com ... | Product Name | Ammonium metavanadate ACS reagent, ≥99.0% | ... | CAS Number | 7803-55-6 |\n# Certificate of Analysis\n\n**Sigma-Aldrich**\n\n3050 Spruce Street, Saint Louis, MO 63103, USA  \nWebsite: www.sigma-aldrich.com  \nEmail USA: techserv@sial.com  \nOutside USA: eurtechserv@sial.com\n\n## Product Information\n\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Product Name | Ammonium metavanadate ACS reagent, ≥99.0% |\n| Product Number | 398128-50G |\n| Batch Number | 0000426388 |\n| Source Batch | 0000368017 |\n| CAS Number | 7803-55-6 |\n| MDL Number | MFCD00011430 |\n| Molecular Formula | H₄NO₃V |\